## The owner words and the PM spec

- Daniel, the look note on the r5 covers, Google Tasks NXlkaVBtUW9hZWRuU1J6UA, 2026-11-10 14:50,
  relayed by the PM, word for word: "I want an alternate where we just use the horizontal logo as
  the entire top Chrome here, meaning the logo is the only thing on the top and it doesn't repeat
  the words story Time Advantage the way we have now".
- The PM spec: keep r5 exactly as it is (option A). Make one alternate, option A2, of the student
  and the teacher covers, front and back. The top holds only the horizontal logo, on its own amber
  #FCD34D tile with a brown #92400E edge. The logo is centered in the tile within 1 mm and fills
  about 80 % of the tile height. The tile is centered at the top and takes about 80 % to 85 % of
  the cover width. The tile replaces the square logo and the title banner of the fronts, and the
  logo box and the title banner of the backs. The plaque, the Sprout tab, the story panel, the
  contact sign with the RA mark, the QR, the art, no game bar, and 0 Type 3 fonts stay.
- The design: an opt in top style. `QuestRenderOptions.top` is `banner` (the default, r5) or
  `hlogo` (A2). The build takes the flag `--top banner|hlogo`. The tile part is
  `data-part="logo-tile"` and holds one img of the horizontal logo. The box table holds the key
  `<kind>:logo-tile` for the 2 fronts and the 2 backs.

